@startuml
title Delete Vocabulary Sequence (/vocabulary/delete and /api/admin/words/{id})

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Admin
boundary "Vocabulary UI" as VocabularyUi
control "VocabularyController\n(FE Dashboard)" as FeController
control "AdminWordsController\n(BE API)" as BeController
control "WordAdminService" as WordService
control "IWordAdminService" as IWordAdminService
entity "Word" as WordEntity
entity "UserListWord" as UserListWordEntity
entity "UserWordProgress" as UserWordProgressEntity
control "WordAdminRepository" as WordRepository
control "IWordAdminRepository" as IWordAdminRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL

note over VocabularyUi, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Dashboard UI file exists: Views/Vocabulary/Index.cshtml.
FE controller exists: VocabularyController.
BE controller exists: AdminWordsController.
Dashboard route is POST /vocabulary/delete.
VocaNovaApiClient calls DELETE /api/admin/words/{id}.
API delete endpoint uses route id only and returns bool in the response envelope.
API endpoint is protected by SuperAdmin policy.
Delete is soft delete: word status becomes deleted.
Entities exist: Word, UserListWord and UserWordProgress.
Interfaces used in code: IWordAdminService, IWordAdminRepository.
end note

Admin -> VocabularyUi: Click Delete vocabulary
VocabularyUi -> FeController: POST /vocabulary/delete\nid, returnUrl?
FeController -> BeController: VocaNovaApiClient.DeleteWordAsync(id)\nDELETE /api/admin/words/{id}
BeController -> BeController: Check super admin authorization
BeController -> IWordAdminService: SoftDeleteAsync(id)
IWordAdminService -> WordService: SoftDeleteAsync(id)
WordService -> IWordAdminRepository: SetWordStatusAsync(id, deleted)
IWordAdminRepository -> WordRepository: SetWordStatusAsync(id, deleted)
WordRepository -> DbContext: Find Word
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT words
MySQL --> DbContext: Word row or null
DbContext -> WordEntity: Read Word?
WordEntity --> DbContext: Word or null

alt Word not found
    DbContext --> WordRepository: null
    WordRepository --> WordService: false
    WordService --> BeController: NotFound result
    BeController --> FeController: HTTP 404 error
    FeController --> VocabularyUi: Show delete error
else Word found
    WordRepository -> WordEntity: Set status deleted\nand update timestamp
    WordEntity --> WordRepository: Word updated
    WordRepository -> DbContext: Track Word status
    DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE words
    MySQL --> DbContext: Update result
    DbContext --> WordRepository: Save result
    WordRepository --> WordService: true

    WordService -> IWordAdminRepository: GetReferencingUserIdsAsync(id)
    IWordAdminRepository -> WordRepository: GetReferencingUserIdsAsync(id)
    WordRepository -> DbContext: Query list/progress references
    DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT user_list_words\nUNION SELECT user_word_progresses
    MySQL --> DbContext: Referencing user ids
    DbContext -> UserListWordEntity: Read active UserListWord rows
    DbContext -> UserWordProgressEntity: Read UserWordProgress rows
    UserListWordEntity --> DbContext: List user ids
    UserWordProgressEntity --> DbContext: Progress user ids
    DbContext --> WordRepository: Referencing user ids
    WordRepository --> WordService: Referencing user ids

    WordService --> BeController: Success result
    BeController --> FeController: HTTP 200 OK
    FeController --> VocabularyUi: Show deleted feedback\nand return to list
end

@enduml
